@host = http://localhost:5109
@dealershipId = 1a0b0000-0000-4000-8000-00000000000d
@oilChangeId = 3c2b0d50-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@evBatteryCheckId = 3c2b0d50-0000-4000-8000-000000000007

### Liveness probe
GET {{host}}/health

### Availability — a seeded weekday, oil change (picks Alina, the narrowest-skilled free technician)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/availability?dealershipId={{dealershipId}}&serviceTypeId={{oilChangeId}}&date=2026-03-02

### Availability — closed day (Sunday): 200 with opensAtUtc null and no slots
GET {{host}}/api/v1/availability?dealershipId={{dealershipId}}&serviceTypeId={{oilChangeId}}&date=2026-03-01

### Availability — Saturday, EV battery check: only the 09:00 slot fits the 09:00-13:00 window
GET {{host}}/api/v1/availability?dealershipId={{dealershipId}}&serviceTypeId={{evBatteryCheckId}}&date=2026-03-07

### Availability — unknown dealership: 404
GET {{host}}/api/v1/availability?dealershipId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&serviceTypeId={{oilChangeId}}&date=2026-03-02
